            "created_at": "2025-08-29T17:19:26.236571+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 2 depends on how well you did round 1 and how your team is playing. \n\nSafest bet is to double down on your orbs this round and get smart orbs and nano cola. If you can't afford nano cola get energized bracers. \n\nAnother option is to get alternative energy. This is usually best next round after you get Phantasm, however can still be strong at this stage if your team is sticking close together. \n\nSpend leftover money on whatever greens you can. If you're going safe orbs this round I'd recommend Power Playbook and if you're going alternative energy I'd recommend Weapon grease or Compensator.",
