        {
            "id": "6de53f3e-22e2-4597-91c8-617ffb897976",
            "build_id": "f8d1d543-6c77-4e14-925e-8f87e5d5da81",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-29T17:19:26.236571+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 is when we start focusing more on the left click (obviously still spamming orbs whenever it is off cooldown). \n\nNow that we have Phantasm you want to get Altenative Energy. You want to place these orbs stratigeticly to get optimum usage. So at choke holds that your team is holding, near your tank or even to save yourself if the other support is lacking in the healing department. Think of them similarly to a healing pylon.\n\nAt this point you should have unlimited left click and hopefully your team has caught onto your build and is sticking close by to benefit from your stationary orbs and left click heals. \n\nDepending on how the other teams healing output is determins where you go here. If they have a pocket mercy, zen or moira it's usually the best idea to pick up anti heals here. Otherwise, Superflexor is the best choice. \n\nIf you can't afford these then High Capacity Tubing, Nano Cola or Energised bracers are good options. Smart orbs pairs well with Cyber Venom if you need anti heals.",
